{#-
  JsonConverters and top-level fromJson/toJson helpers for the abstract field
  types whose Dart representation differs from their JSON wire form.

  The top-level functions (decimalFromJson, decimalToJson, …) are the preferred
  Freezed 3.x approach: referenced via @JsonKey(fromJson:..., toJson:...) on
  each field, avoiding the DefaultValue.defaultValue null crash that occurs when
  @JsonConverter subclass annotations are placed directly on factory constructor
  parameters.

  The class implementations (DecimalConverter, BytesConverter,
  UtcDateTimeConverter) are retained for any hand-written code that still uses
  the class-annotation pattern.

  Project-agnostic — contains no entity-specific code.
-#}
